s with an IconScout plan. Browse our pricing and plans for Individual and Team Plans."},"plans-and-pricing":{"title":"IconScout Pricing and Plans – Individual and Team Plans","description":"Get Unlimited Access to {assets_count} illustrations, 3D illustrations, icons and Lottie animations with an IconScout plan. Browse our pricing and plans for Individual and Team Plans."},"plugins":{"title":"IconScout Plugins and Apps for your favorite Design Tools & Integrations","description":"Get access to {assets_count} design assets right within your favorite design tools. The IconScout plugin integrates seamlessly with Figma, Canva, Adobe XD, WordPress and more"},"download":{"title":"Free Download IconScout Desktop App for Windows & macOS","description":"Access over {assets_count} design assets from your Desktop toolbar with IconScout application. Download Free 3D Illustrations, Icons & Lottie Animations","image":"download.png"},"desktop":{"title":"Free Download IconScout Desktop App for Windows & macOS","description":"Access over {assets_count} design assets from your Desktop toolbar with IconScout application. Download Free 3D Illustrations, Icons & Lottie Animations","image":"desktop.png"},"desktop-app":{"title":"IconScout desktop app for Mac, Windows, and Linux – download for free","description":"Access {assets_count} design assets from your desktop and favorite design tools with IconScout’s desktop app and plugins. Download for Mac, Windows & Linux.","image":"desktop-app.png"},"l-3d-abstract":{"title":"50+ Free Earthy Abstract 3D Shapes | IconScout","description":"50+ Free Earthy Abstract 3D Shapes on IconScout","image":"l-3d-abstract.png"},"l-christmas-assets":{"title":"Christmas Design Assets","description":"Over 40,000 high-quality Christmas assets to bring the spirit of Christmas to your designs. IconScout offers curated Christmas-themed icons, illustrations, 3Ds, and Lotties for you to add to your products, communications, and all things design.","image":"l-christmas-assets.png"},"l-assets-of-the-day":{"title":"Asset of the Day | Download Premium design asset for free on IconScout","description":"Download the premium design asset for free. Download from more than {assets_count} design assets on IconScout. Icons | Illustrations | 3D | Lottie Animations.","image":"l-assets-of-the-day.png"},"l-lottie-animations":{"title":"Lottie Animations by IconScout","description":"A library of over 24,000 Lottie Animations for you to enhance your designs. Drive more engagement and improve your user experience with animations that you can use anywhere: web, app, social media, presentations, and more. Say bye to static images.","image":"l-lottie-animations.png"},"gltf-3d-editor":{"title":"3D glTF Editor: Customize and Create Stunning 3D Illustrations - IconScout","description":"IconScout\'s 3D glTF Editor is the ultimate tool to customize and view 3D illustrations in 360°! Simply search or drag and drop your 3D illustrations and tweak them to fit your design needs.","image":"gltf-3d-editor.png"},"unicons":{"title":"Unicons: 4,500+ Free Icon Fonts and SVG Icons - IconScout","description":"4,500+ free icon fonts and SVG icons to help speed up your design and development process. Unicons is available in line, monochrome, solid and thin line icon styles.","image":"unicons.png"},"unicons-getting-started-style":{"title":"Insert Icons on Your Website","description":"Insert Unicons easily on your website by inserting just a few lines of code.","image":"unicons-getting-started-style.png"},"unicons-explore-style":{"title":"Unicons icon library | Line | Monochrome | Solid | Thin Line","description":"4500+ free vector icons - Unicons in Line, Monochrome, Solid and Thin Line style by IconScout.","image":"unicons-explore-style.png"},"svg-editor":{"title":"Online SVG Editor - Edit Your Vector Icons and Illustrations - IconScout","description":"Edit your vector icons and illustrations with IconScout’s SVG editor. Add multiple SVG via the search panel, delete selected objects, use the color palette to customize your design, and more.","keywords":"Change SVG Color","image":"svg-editor.png"},"special-scout-plan-for-startup-students-hackathon-ngo":{"title":"Specialscout Plan for Startups | IconScout","description":"Get free access to thousands of premium icons, illustrations, 3D assets, and lottie animations for startups, nonprofits, schools, colleges and events."},"github-students":{"title":"IconScout GitHub Student Developer Pack | Get Free Design assets ","description":"IconScout GitHub Student Developer Pack is all you need to get free access to thousands of premium icons, illustrations, 3d assets and lottie animations."},"top-icons":{"title":"Top Trending Icons based on Popular Searches | IconScout","description":"Explore most popular icons like Business icons and SEO icons to latest trending topics such as Coronavirus icons. Download top icons now!"},"blog":{"title":"IconScout Blog - Updates, Ideas, and Design Inspirations ","description":"Explore the IconScout blog - articles and design news about UI and UX design, product design, design tools and software, design strategies and tips."},"blog-page-page":{"title":"IconScout Blog","description":"Dive into the world of design knowledge from our experts at IconScout. Learn about icon design, illustration design, product design, featured work from world\'s popular artists and more."},"blog-tag-slug":{"title":"{tag} Blog | IconScout","description":"Explore the IconScout blog - articles and design news about UI and UX design, product design, design tools and software, design strategies and tips."},"blog-author-slug":{"title":"{author} | Author at IconScout","description":"Explore the IconScout blog - articles and design news about UI and UX design, product design, design tools and software, design strategies and tips."},"converter-slug":{"title":"Convert {from} to {to} Online By IconScout\'s File Converter","description":"Our free online file converter allows you to convert 