ee {query} Icon Fonts","description":"Explore a world of minimalistic design with IconScout\'s {query} collection of line interface icons. These {query} icon fonts - Unicons embody simplicity and sophistication, ideal for creating a sleek and modern visual experience for any use case."},"meta":{"title":"Free {query} Icon Fonts - Download in SVG, Font, Vue, React | Unicons by IconScout","description":"Discover our {query} collection of free line font icons that add simplicity to your designs. Enhance your UI with these sleek and modern font icons - Unicons by IconScout."},"item":{"hero":{"title":"Free {query} Icon Font","description":"Explore exclusive {query} free line interface icons at IconScout. Unicons offer a diverse selection of icons for Web, App, and more. Download as SVG or copy code for Font, Vue, React, and more. Access a variety of customizable icons in the {category} category."},"meta":{"title":"Free {query} Icon Font - Download in SVG, Font, Vue, React | Unicons by IconScout","description":"Discover exclusive {query} free line interface icons at IconScout. Explore our {category} collection of Unicons and SVG icons, perfect for UI designs. Compatible with Web, iOS, and Android."}},"get_started":{"hero":{"title":"Start Using Unicons via IconScout CDN – Free and Scalable Line Icons","description":"Integrate Unicons, the free line icon library from IconScout, using our global CDN. Add scalable SVG icons to your projects effortlessly, customize them, and boost your website\'s performance."},"meta":{"title":"Unicons – Free Line Icons via IconScout CDN | Scalable SVG Icon Library","description":"Discover Unicons, the free line icon library by IconScout. Learn how to add scalable SVG icons to your project using our fast and reliable CDN for optimized performance."}},"faqs":[{"question":"What is Unicons, and how can I use them with IconScout CDN?","answer":"Unicons is a free line icon library provided by IconScout. You can easily integrate Unicons into your project using IconScout CDN. Simply copy the CDN link into your HTML\'s <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> section and start adding icons to your site."},{"question":"How do I add free line icons from Unicons using IconScout CDN?","answer":"To add Unicons, copy the provided CDN link into your HTML file\'s <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> section. Then, use the icon class names to embed icons directly into your website, making them scalable and customizable."},{"question":"Are Unicons free to use?","answer":"Yes, Unicons is a free line icon library. You can use these icons in both personal and commercial projects without any cost. Using IconScout CDN makes the integration process even simpler and faster."},{"question":"Can I customize the SVG icons from Unicons?","answer":"Absolutely! With Unicons integrated through IconScout CDN, you can use CSS to customize the icons\' color, size, and effects, providing full control over their appearance in your project."},{"question":"How does IconScout CDN improve the performance of my icons?","answer":"IconScout CDN ensures your icons are delivered quickly and reliably across the globe. Using the CDN for your Unicons means faster loading times, optimized SVG icons, and a more responsive website overall."},{"question":"What makes Unicons different from other icon libraries?","answer":"Unicons offers a unique collection of free line icons, designed for flexibility and scalability. Delivered via IconScout CDN, Unicons ensures a seamless integration process, with SVG icons that are easy to customize and perfect for any project."},{"question":"Can I use Unicons in React, Vue, or other frameworks?","answer":"Yes! Unicons can be easily used in popular frameworks like React, Vue, and Angular by importing the IconScout CDN link into your main project file. This allows you to integrate high-quality SVG icons quickly and efficiently."}]},"monochrome":{"name":"Monochrome","slug":"monochromes","hero":{"title":"{query} Icon Fonts - Monochrome Interface Icons",